    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>Sonic damage is considered to be Energy damage in all ways. However, ranged weapons that deal Sonic damage cannot be deflected by a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a>. If a weapon deals bonus Sonic damage (such as those with certain <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Gear_Templates\" title=\"Gear Templates\">Gear Templates</a>) in addition to its normal damage and is not purely an Energy attack, the attack can be deflected by a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightsaber\">Lightsaber</a>, but the target still takes the Sonic damage regardless (just not the weapon's normal Energy damage) if the attack would normally hit. </p>",
